 Cleo Murphy, T.O. Murphy and Dwain Murphy , all of Tyler; daughters, Nina Mae  Warren, Katherine Cobb and Christine Mosley Fuller, all of Tyler; sisters Eulalia Choice andJessie Choice, both of Tyler, Mattie Balwin, Fort Worth, and Cleo Francis, Fort Lauderdale, Fla.;  34 grandchildren; 29 great-grandchildren; and one great-great-grandchild.  Pallbearers will be friends of the family. Honorary pallbearersare grandsons."], "famc": ["@F129@"], "fams": ["@F124@"]}, "@I319@": {"id": "@I319@", "name": "Eulalia Katherine Choice", "given": "Eulalia Katherine", "surname": "Choice", "sex": "F", "birth": {"date": "Sep 21 1921", "place": "Tyler, Texas"}, "death": {"date": "Aug 10 2007", "place": "Dallas, Texas"}, "burial": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "occupation": [], "education": [], "notes": [], "famc": ["@F129@"], "fams": []}, "@I341@": {"id": "@I341@", "name": "Lottie C.", "given": "Lottie", "surname": "C.", "sex": "F", "birth": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "death": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "burial": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "occupation": [], "education": [], "notes": [], "famc": ["@F126@"], "fams": [], "living": true}, "@I338@": {"id": "@I338@", "name": "Emma C.", "given": "Emma", "surname": "C.", "sex": "F", "birth": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "death": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "burial": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "occupation": [], "education": [], "notes": [], "famc": ["@F126@"], "fams": ["@F127@"], "living": true}, "@I340@": {"id": "@I340@", "name": "Benny C.", "given": "Benny", "surname": "C.", "sex": "M", "birth": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "death": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "burial": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "occupation": [], "education": [], "notes": [], "famc": ["@F126@"], "fams": [], "living": true}, "@I327@": {"id": "@I327@", "name": "Nina M.", "given": "Nina", "surname": "M.", "sex": "F", "birth": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "death": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "burial": {"date": "", "place": ""}, "occupation": [], "education": [], "notes": [], "famc": ["@F